+## 5. Continuation ledger
+
+The tables use only JSON objects whose embedded `driver_sha256` equals the
+pinned digest above.  Each row states raw labels added at that stage, new
+outer rational pivots, the change in cumulative joint rational rank, exact
+localized dimension, remainder status, external wall time, and cumulative-
+stage invocation peak RSS.  The validator checks contiguous stage
+specifications, generated row accounting, pivot ledgers, dimension formulas,
+branch identity, and every artifact hash.
