+
+## 7. Singular and consistency controls
+
+For a nonzero polynomial residue the generated Singular ring is over characteristic zero
+with `dp` ordering on the active generators followed by the wrapper.  The
+ideal includes `Zrho*rho-1` or `Zc*c-1`.  The wrapper controls are
+
+```text
+<p,Zp-1>       -> unit ideal,
+<p-1,Zp-1>     -> nonunit ideal.
+```
+
+The raw residue's unit status is recorded rather than assumed.  A branch is
+declared `DEAD` only if the localized exact ideal is the unit ideal.  Otherwise
+the Singular codimension is subtracted from the post-`Q*` generator count.
+For the `delta=2` death, an independent replay of the generated Singular file
+prints `dim=-1`, basis `1`, and controls `0,1,0`: the deliberately empty
+control and the raw constant ideal are unit, while the point control is
+nonunit.  No modular rank is promoted to an exact result.
+
+## 8. Reproducibility and fleet decision
+
+`{{ARTIFACT_TABLE}}`
+
+The branches are independent after the shared custody and structural checks,
+so two machines can run them without communication.  A stateful incremental
+implementation must process bands sequentially because each quotient is
+inherited by the next.  This self-contained driver instead recomputes every
+cumulative quotient, so distinct endpoint stages can run on separate machines
+at the cost of duplicated prefix work; the surviving branch used that mode
+after the other branch died.  A modular-prime backend is not shipped here.
+Independent primes could be added only as hypothetical rank/leader scouts;
+any claimed rank, inconsistency, or dimension would still have to be lifted
+and rechecked over `Q`, discarding primes that divide a prospective pivot.
+
+For an eight-core fleet before a branch dies, two exact branch workers, up to
+four lower-priority cumulative-stage workers, one replay worker, and one
+audit/serialization worker are independent.  After a branch dies its worker
+can take the next cumulative endpoint of the survivor.  The table reports
+isolated cumulative-invocation RSS, not marginal memory for just the newly
+added rows.  Concurrent memory planning should sum those measured peaks and
+leave separate room for Singular if a genuine polynomial residue appears.
+
+## 9. FALLACY-v2 audit and verdicts
