+emitted.  The pole substitutions and branch hypotheses are imported from the
+charged section 6 prescription; this lane does not infer new geometric pole
+identities.  No lower bound is promoted to attainment.  The ring,
+localization, generator order, and imported coordinate-map limitation are
+stated.  Prime marks are not used ambiguously.  The absent effective-root
+bridge remains typed `OPEN[EFFECTIVE-T2-T3-BRIDGE]`.

