+The exact next system is supplied as
+`runs/delta52/next-stage8-system.json`, SHA-256
+`a050af8c5d4bbb703babb2ce2ee57a70c411eb801226ac9f5cdcffbfa0bfa699`.
+It contains the same 869 generator names, the accepted stage-7 JSON hash, the
+frozen-input dependency, the pinned engine hash, and executable argv.  Its
+next band is pole local power 16 with `(F,G)=(-173,-110)`, no further retained
+outer `D1` offset, and all 156 coefficients `k=0,...,155` of Jacobian degree
+155.  The exact executable definition is
