+Every delivered file under the driver directory is additionally covered by
+`artifact-manifest.sha256`, SHA-256
+`5b5652034edc555071358316db5aeca8d35a27bbb33e44fe56358571b127c2b2`,
+which excludes itself.  The stage ledgers contain
