+## 6. Stop condition, surviving coordinates, and next systems
+
+The band computation was stopped at 2026-09-03 21:57 UTC, 134 minutes 58
+seconds after the receipt start, reserving the remaining part of the 150-minute
+lane for final validation, custody generation, and sealing.  A cumulative
+stage-8 trial was interrupted at that point after 47 min 57.77 s of
+host-contended execution; its stdout JSON was still zero bytes.  An earlier
+lower-priority stage-9 trial was likewise interrupted with zero-byte JSON so
+that the contiguous critical path could finish.  Neither interrupted output
+is copied into `box/g9966band-20260903`, cited as evidence, or included in the
+validated ledger.  The exact accepted stop is therefore stage 7, not stage 8
+or 9.
+
+The `delta=2` branch has no next system because its stage-4 ideal is the unit
+ideal.  The consistent `delta=5/2` finite quotient has exactly **869** free
+coordinates because its residue is zero.  The complete sorted list (869 lines)
+is `runs/delta52/stage7-free-coefficients.txt`, SHA-256
