+
+```text
+6702 - (5598 outer-D2 + 176 outer-D1 + 59 joint-Q*) = 869.
+```
+
+All 1,125 named joint-prefix rows account as 59 pivots plus 1,066 zero or
+dependent rows.  There is no residue at any accepted stage, so there is no
+nonlinear residue to send to Singular.  After stage 0, the successive
+dimension decrements are `47,42,34,27,19,14,11`; all are positive.  Thus the
+two-consecutive-stagnant-band rule did not trigger.
