+python3 box/g9966band-20260903/band_engine.py --branch delta52 --stage 8
+```
+
+with engine SHA-256
+`3bd2937d75d59d59edeca1b89eba286fd2711f2d608109e7fd8971b64e059ac9`.
+The manifest is deliberately an executable definition, not a claim that it
+serializes expanded equations or the unavailable full inverse from `K2c` to
